cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: eeg-sleep
abstract: Automatic sleep staging (30-s epochs with confidence), sleep statistics, sleep spindles and slow waves
  from clinical scalp EEG with YASA, for the Pennsieve scalp EEG workflows. Stages on one central EEG derivation
  (EEG only), detects spindles and slow waves in N2/N3 on every EEG channel with bad segments and seizures left
  out, and writes the hypnogram that eeg-spikes uses for spike rates per sleep stage.
